<div class="alert alert-warning">
  <strong>The AI&rsquo;s draft could not be used.</strong>
  <p class="mb-1"><%= draft.failure_reason %>.</p>
  <p class="mb-2 small">
    The answer did not match the expected shape or broke one of this Program&rsquo;s rules: exactly the number of
    sessions you asked for, every agenda inside the session length, and every task given to the mentor or the
    mentee. Draft again, or edit the template in the admin panel to tighten the instructions.
  </p>
  <%= render "mentor_offers/draft_button", mentor_offer: mentor_offer, label: "Retry",
             button_class: "btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm" %>
</div>
